acceptance_criteria: "A declared adversarial corpus with a measured escape rate exists for credential_key_assignment and URL-userinfo redaction; Escaped JSON literals are judged for entropy on their decoded original value; Env-style lines with an all-caps key detect unquoted credentials holding ? : or | without re-flagging code"
